{
  "name": "Young Nurses, Big Impact: The SONAM Approach",
  "parent_id": 203313870937371,
  "group_id": "125329ad-86b1-43b0-bed3-cf5ab7ac1087",
  "alternates": [],
  "created_at": "2026-07-31T09:47:13.202Z",
  "deleted_at": null,
  "sort_by_date": null,
  "tag_list": [],
  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T15:08:00.294Z",
  "published_at": "2026-08-12T15:08:00.279Z",
  "id": 203987489626998,
  "uuid": "46f2b3bb-a013-493b-84f3-d20655c4373d",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "e51cb41a-a5a9-6c5a-d997-d52d4c90ff9b",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "2086456c-4d97-4337-7ebd-df2254bff98e",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Second-year Bachelor of Science in Nursing (BScN) students, Mercy and Max, are currently immersed in their first clinical rotation at the Aga Khan University Hospital in Nairobi. Their experiences offer a glimpse into the distinctive learning journey that SONAM EA provides.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"I didn't expect it to be so engaging,\" Mercy shared. \"I thought it might be less hands-on, but it's been the opposite.\" From patient rounds and medication administration to complex procedures like feeding tube insertion and wound care, Mercy and her peers are actively involved in patient care. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"Seeing patients improve after receiving medication or witnessing a code blue situation has been incredibly impactful,\" she added. \"It's amazing how classroom knowledge translates into real-world practice.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Max, who is interning in the pediatric ward, echoes Mercy's sentiments. \"One of the most impactful experiences I've had was caring for a child who was very ill and required constant monitoring and support,\" he said. \"It was challenging, but also deeply rewarding to witness his gradual improvement.\" ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "SONAM EA's Direct-Entry clinical rotations offer several advantages. These rotations, which commence in their second year, transition students from the foundational sciences of nursing to the hands-on skills needed for patient care. This experience is not only about applying their theoretical knowledge but also about embracing the professional culture of nursing through direct exposure to clinical settings. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "During these rotations, students gain invaluable insights into the complexities of nursing that extend beyond textbooks. They learn essential skills such as effective patient communication, collaboration with healthcare teams, and situational critical thinking-abilities crucial for adapting to real-life healthcare environments. This hands-on training bridges the gap between academic learning and practical application, helping students cultivate a holistic understanding of nursing as both an art and a science. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"Our professors have been incredibly supportive,\" Max said. \"They've provided guidance and advice, and they've been available to answer our questions.\" Mercy added, \"I've found the support from our professors and clinical instructors to be invaluable. They've created a supportive learning environment and have been patient and understanding.\" ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "By integrating clinical rotations early in the curriculum, SONAM EA empowers its students to become highly skilled and compassionate nurses. This unique approach sets the stage for a successful and fulfilling career in healthcare.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
